      "source": "AppearanceChoices.svelte (choose), DropdownItem.svelte (chosen)",
      "certain": true,
      "note": "The fourth child of the colour scheme group is Dark, after the label. The current appearance is a bindable prop: the component moves the selection itself and passes the new appearance to onchoose, where the caller applies and saves it. Inside a Dropdown the prevented default leaves the menu open."
    }
  ]
